    "detailed_description": "<strong>Dodolly Tales</strong> introduces players to an RPG with survivor-like elements. Take command of your favorite doll, level up, and obtain powerful magic to aid you in the battle against relentless hordes of lethal, rat-like puppets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRACE THE DESTINY OF THE DODOLLIES</h2>Engage in fast-paced, frenetic combat as you destroy, defend, and rescue to unlock new magical powers. Navigate the battlefield by drawing paths on the map, staying one step ahead, and unleashing each Dodolly\u2019s unique abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/1359279dc5ab24c7b5870f10d355df0e.poster.avif?t=1746156566\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/1359279dc5ab24c7b5870f10d355df0e.webm?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/1359279dc5ab24c7b5870f10d355df0e.mp4?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHIMSICAL WORLDS AWAIT YOU</h2>Journey from the confined, mysterious lab of a vile sorcerer to other realms, such as sugar-coated dunes and futuristic colonial cities, each filled with new challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/411d2121eb14f140ca4c05e5e961609b.poster.avif?t=1746156566\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/411d2121eb14f140ca4c05e5e961609b.webm?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/411d2121eb14f140ca4c05e5e961609b.mp4?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFY YOUR CREATOR</h2>A big bad is sending an endless army of puppets, determined to bring you under his control. Defeat him and seek revenge for what he did.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Dodolly Tales</strong> introduces players to an RPG with survivor-like elements. Take command of your favorite doll, level up, and obtain powerful magic to aid you in the battle against relentless hordes of lethal, rat-like puppets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRACE THE DESTINY OF THE DODOLLIES</h2>Engage in fast-paced, frenetic combat as you destroy, defend, and rescue to unlock new magical powers. Navigate the battlefield by drawing paths on the map, staying one step ahead, and unleashing each Dodolly\u2019s unique abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/1359279dc5ab24c7b5870f10d355df0e.poster.avif?t=1746156566\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/1359279dc5ab24c7b5870f10d355df0e.webm?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/1359279dc5ab24c7b5870f10d355df0e.mp4?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHIMSICAL WORLDS AWAIT YOU</h2>Journey from the confined, mysterious lab of a vile sorcerer to other realms, such as sugar-coated dunes and futuristic colonial cities, each filled with new challenges.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/411d2121eb14f140ca4c05e5e961609b.poster.avif?t=1746156566\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/411d2121eb14f140ca4c05e5e961609b.webm?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667370/extras/411d2121eb14f140ca4c05e5e961609b.mp4?t=1746156566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFY YOUR CREATOR</h2>A big bad is sending an endless army of puppets, determined to bring you under his control. Defeat him and seek revenge for what he did.",
